   - [`docs/ja/projects/prj-0001/controls/project-register/pjr-fmyk-stsd-catalog-review.md`](file:///workspaces/specdojo-workspace/worktrees/prj-0001-PJR-FMYK/docs/ja/projects/prj-0001/controls/project-register/pjr-fmyk-stsd-catalog-review.md)

